{"id":"wut","lemma":"Wut","pos":"noun","rank":1707,"glosses":["rage; fury; outrage","anger; usually “strong, hateful anger” in literary German, but not necessarily in the vernacular","ecstasy; frenzy"],"ipa":"/vuːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/De-Wut.ogg/De-Wut.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Wut"},"examples":[{"text":"Er konnte seine Wut nicht kontrollieren.","en":"He could not control his anger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40952","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to check"}]},{"text":"Sie war außer sich vor Wut.","en":"She was livid.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"beside oneself"]]},{"text":"Ihre Stimme bebte vor Wut.","en":"Her voice trembled with rage.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"voice"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Sie konnte vor lauter Wut nicht sprechen.","en":"She was so angry that she could not speak.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"sincere"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak"}]},{"text":"Wut ist ein zweischneidiges Schwert.","en":"Anger is a double-edged sword.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"double-edged sword"]]}]}